    <string name="privacy_body">Muslim respects your privacy and does not collect your data.\n\n• No tracking: no ad SDKs, analytics or marketing trackers.\n• Data stays on your device: all your data (location, settings, bookmarks) is stored locally on your device only.\n• Location is used locally: your coordinates are used to calculate prayer pachanaka ukatxa qibla dispositivomanxa, ukatxa janipuniwa kuna anqäxa servidor ukaru apayatakiti.\n• Permisos ukaxa wakisi ukjakiwa: permisos (kawkhankata, yatiyawinaka) mayipxta kunapachatixa mä lurawixa chiqpachansa munaski ukhakiw mayipxta, qhana qhananchawimpi.\n• Janiwa conectividad forzada ukaxa utjkiti: app ukaxa irnaqarakiw offline; red apnaqañax taqpach extras ukanakatakix opcional ukhamawa kunjamatix recitaciones ukanakax apkataña.\n\nAka kamachix abierto-codigo ukan imañ utapawa ukatx ayllunakan uñakipañatakiw jist’arataraki.</string>
